---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// CITY PAGE, see video-production-nolensville-tn.astro for the shared rules.
// Confirmed Murfreesboro work: TWO standing locations in Geoff's scheduling
// system, both real estate offices: CBSR Murfreesboro (1980 Old Fort Pkwy)
// and the Realty One office (Medical Center Pkwy). The page leads with real
// estate because that is what is proven here; do not invent other Murfreesboro
// jobs. Honest distance: about 35 minutes from base.
//
// July 2026 (from Geoff's production calendar, read 2026-08-02): a live event
// filmed at the CBSR Murfreesboro office (Jul 16) and a listing shoot in
// Murfreesboro (Jul 20). Client street addresses stay off the page.
const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  serviceType: 'Video production and photography',
  provider: { '@id': 'https://sdubmedia.com/#business' },
  areaServed: { '@type': 'City', name: 'Murfreesboro', containedInPlace: { '@type': 'State', name: 'Tennessee' } },
};
---
<Layout
  title="Murfreesboro TN Real Estate Photography & Video | SDub Media"
  description="Listing photography, real estate video and business content in Murfreesboro, TN. SDub Media already shoots at two Murfreesboro real estate offices on a standing schedule."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<section>
  <div class="container-narrow text-center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Murfreesboro, TN</span>
    <h1>Two Murfreesboro offices already book us.</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">Both are real estate offices, and both are standing locations on our calendar. Last month alone that meant filming a live event at one office and shooting a listing across town. If you list property in Rutherford County, the crew is already making the drive.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Start a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--soft);">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">For agents</span>
    <h2>Listings, priced like a commodity, shot like they matter.</h2>
    <ul class="facts">
      <li><strong>$200 per listing</strong> for photography, so you know the number before you call</li>
      <li><strong>48-hour turnaround</strong>, because a listing that goes live Thursday cannot wait a week</li>
      <li><strong>$200 video, $50 drone add-on</strong>, from a photographer who shoots homes only</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">The full pricing lives on the <a href="/real-estate-photography/">real estate photography page</a>, published, not quoted-on-request.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="container" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
    <div class="wedding-strip">
      <img src="/images/real-estate/exterior-front.jpg" alt="The front elevation of a stone home in clear daylight" loading="lazy" width="1400" height="935" />
      <img src="/images/real-estate/kitchen.jpg" alt="A listing kitchen, evenly lit with true colors" loading="lazy" width="1600" height="1069" />
      <img src="/images/real-estate/pool-aerial.jpg" alt="Aerial of a pool and spa looking out to a golf fairway" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="691" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">Beyond listings</span>
    <h2>What else makes the drive worth it.</h2>
    <p>The 35 minutes from our base to Murfreesboro is the same drive our recurring clients already pay for, in the other direction. Everything on the site travels:</p>
    <ul class="facts">
      <li><a href="/business/"><strong>Recurring content</strong></a> for businesses that need to show up weekly</li>
      <li><a href="/corporate-events/"><strong>Event coverage</strong></a>: every talk archived, one reel that earns</li>
      <li><a href="/dance/"><strong>Dance recitals</strong></a>: the full program for families, the cut for your site</li>
      <li><a href="/weddings/"><strong>Weddings</strong></a>: a few a year, unhurried on purpose</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a listing or a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
